                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "The current project holds raw and processed data from 12 couples performing multiperson and single person sports related movements. The movements are captures with 8 Sony camera's from Theia3D (markerless motion capture system) and 16 Vicon camera's (marker-based motion capture system). The dataset is more widely explained in the article \"Examining the Concurrent Validity of Markerless Motion Capture in Dual-Athlete Team Sports Movements\" by Oonk et al. (2025)."
                },
